@* card.md §2.6 (right panel) / §3.9: the prototype seeds a 7-month delta bar row and a
   pace sentence, but Phase 2's CensusDto carries no deltas/dLabels series -- only the
   fixed six bars and QualifyingObservations. §3.9's own LOW DATA rule ("< 2 census
   observations" -> "census history too young to compute pace") always applies: the
   2026-09-01 floor (D-033) means no card has two qualifying observations yet. Rule 2
   (never compute on insufficient data): render the degrade always, never the bar row
   or pace sentence the prototype shows. *@
@using CardStock.Application.Cards

<div class="activity-panel">
    <div class="activity-header">
        <h2>Grading activity · PSA 10 slabs added</h2>
        <span class="obs-badge" title="@BadgeTooltip()">@(Census.QualifyingObservations) OBS</span>
    </div>
    <p class="activity-degrade">census history too young to compute pace</p>
</div>

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public CensusDto Census { get; set; } = default!;

    private string BadgeTooltip() =>
        $"Census observations counted from 2026-09-01 — {Census.QualifyingObservations} so far; deltas need two.";
}
